(S)-2-amino-3-(1H-imidazol-4-yl)propanoic acid\",\n      \"common_name\": \"histidine\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/C6H9N3O2/c7-5(6(10)11)3-9-2-1-8-4-9/h1-2,4-5H,3,7H2,(H,10,11)/t5-/m0/s1\",\n      \"role\": \"target\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_013\",\n      \"formula\": \"CO\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"carbon monoxide\",\n      \"common_name\": null,\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/CO/c1-2\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Hydrothermal\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_014\",\n      \"formula\": \"H2\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"dihydrogen\",\n      \"common_name\": \"hydrogen\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/H2/h1H\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Hydrothermal\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_015\",\n      \"formula\": \"C\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"methane\",\n      \"common_name\": \"methane\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/CH4/h1H4\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_016\",\n      \"formula\": \"N2\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"dinitrogen\",\n      \"common_name\": \"nitrogen\",\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/N2/c1-2\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"mol_017\",\n      \"formula\": \"C10H8\",\n      \"iupac_name\": \"naphthalene\",\n      \"common_name\": null,\n      \"inchi\": \"InChI=1S/C10H8/c1-2-4-6-10-8-5-3-7-9(1)10/h1-8H\",\n      \"role\": \"starting\",\n      \"environment_formed\": \"Extraterrestrial\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reactions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rxn_001\",\n      \"name\": \"Formose reaction: formaldehyde \u2192 aldose tetroses (including erythrose)\",\n      \"inputs\": [\"mol_003\", \"mol_004\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"mol_001\"],\n      \"environment\": \"Surface\",\n      \"agents\": [\"Ca(OH)2 (calcium hydroxide, plausible mineral)\"],\n      \"conditions\": {\n        \"temperature\": \"320-350K\",\n        \"pressure\": \"1 atm\",\n        \"catalyst\": \"Ca(OH)2\",\n        \"aqueous\": true,\n        \"other\": \"alkaline aqueous; wet-dry or evaporative cycles aid yield\"\n      },\n      \"mechanism\": \"Aldol-type condensation polymerizes formaldehyde to diverse sugars, forming erythrose among many other saccharides.\",\n      \"reasoning\": \"Classic prebiotic formose chemistry demonstrated (Or\u00f3 1961, Miller 1953); formation of C4 sugars including erythrose validated. See V\u00e1zquez-Salazar et al. (2018) for yield critiques.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rxn_002\",\n      \"name\": \"Formamidine from HCN and ammonia\",\n      \"inputs\": [\"mol_010\", \"mol_005\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"mol_002\", \"mol_004\"],\n      \"environment\": \"Surface\",\n      \"agents\": [null],\n      \"conditions\": {\n        \"temperature\": \"290-305K\",\n        \"pressure\": \"1 atm\",\n        \"catalyst\": null,\n        \"aqueous\": true,\n        \"other\": \"concentrated NH3, slightly acidic, rare accumulation\"\n      },\n      \"mechanism\": \"HCN and NH3 react in water to generate the amidine via nucleophilic attack and tautomerization, releasing water.\",\n      \"reasoning\": \"HCN + NH3 \u2192 formamidine well supported (Or\u00f3 1961; Shen et al. 1987); prebiotic accumulation limited by rapid hydrolysis (Shen et al. 1987, V\u00e1zquez-Salazar et al. 2018).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rxn_003\",\n      \"name\": \"Erythrose + formamidine condensation to imidazole-4-glycol\",\n      \"inputs\": [\"mol_001\", \"mol_002\"],\n      \"outputs\": [\"mol_007\", \"mol_004\"],\n      \"environment\": \"Surface\",\n      \"agents\": [null],\n      \"conditions\": {\n        \"temperature\": \"353K (80\u00b0C)\",\n        \"pressure\": \"1 atm\",\n        \"catalyst\": null,\n        \"aqueous\": true,\n        \"other\": \"pH 6.0, 12h, closed system\"\n      },\n      \"mechanism\": \"Amadori-like condensation and dehydration fo